---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="About — Biotite Solutions"
  description="Biotite Solutions is a custom AI systems studio founded by Joe Samara, building production AI systems for biotech, technology, and manufacturing companies."
>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <header class="about-head">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>About</p>
      <h1 class="t-display t-2xl" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:.06s">
        Named after a mineral<br />that forms in <em>clean layers</em>
      </h1>
    </header>
  </section>

  <section class="section--hairline section wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The idea</p>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          Biotite is a mica — a dark, unglamorous mineral whose defining
          property is <strong>perfect cleavage</strong>: it splits naturally
          into thin, distinct, orderly sheets.
        </p>
        <p>
          That's the property we named the studio after, because it's what
          good AI systems have and demos don't. A system you can rely on is
          built in clean layers — data, retrieval, model behavior, agent
          logic, integrations, interface — each engineered so it can be
          inspected, evaluated, and improved on its own. When those layers
          are fused into one clever prompt, you get something that works in a
          meeting and fails in a workflow.
        </p>
        <p>
          Biotite Solutions exists to build the first kind: complete,
          production-oriented AI systems for businesses whose processes,
          data, and software are too specific for off-the-shelf products.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--hairline section wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Principles</p>
      <ul class="about-principles">
        <li data-reveal>
          <h2 class="t-lg">Production is the standard</h2>
          <p>
            A system counts when it runs inside your operation — integrated,
            documented, and evaluated — not when it demos well. We build
            toward that standard from the first week.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal>
          <h2 class="t-lg">Judgment stays human</h2>
          <p>
            We decide deliberately what a system may do on its own and where
            people review its work. Autonomy is an engineering decision with
            an audit trail, never a default.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal>
          <h2 class="t-lg">Measured, not asserted</h2>
          <p>
            Reliability claims come from evaluation against your real cases.
            If we can't measure it yet, we say so and build the measurement.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li data-reveal>
          <h2 class="t-lg">Until the customer is satisfied</h2>
          <p>
            We're a young studio without a fashionable niche, and we treat
            that honestly: our reputation is built one delivered system at a
            time, so we keep working until yours does what we said it would.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--hairline section wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Who you'll work with</p>
      <div class="founder-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="founder-card__identity">
          <img
            src="/joe-samara.webp"
            alt="Joe Samara, founder and engineer at Biotite Solutions"
            width="460"
            height="460"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="founder-card__identity-label">
            <span class="founder-card__rule"></span>
            <span class="t-mono">Founder / Engineer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="t-mono founder-card__role">Founder-led by design</p>
          <h2 class="t-display t-xl founder-card__name">Joe Samara</h2>
          <div class="prose founder-card__bio">
          <p>
              An engineer who has designed and delivered AI systems for
              biotech, technology, and manufacturing companies: custom agents
              in TypeScript and Python, image analysis pipelines with OpenCV,
              retrieval-augmented knowledge systems, AI-assisted video tagging,
              and executive decision-support dashboards integrated in real time
              with systems like HiBob and Greenhouse.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you engage Biotite, the person you meet on the first call is
            the person who architects and builds your system.
          </p>
          </div>
          <ul class="about-links">
            <li>
              <a href={site.social.linkedin} class="link-arrow" rel="noopener">
                LinkedIn
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href={site.social.youtube} class="link-arrow" rel="noopener">
                YouTube
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                </svg>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .about-principles {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .about-principles li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--c-line);
    padding-top: 1.4rem;
  }

  .about-principles li:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .about-principles p {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--c-silver);
    max-width: 36em;
  }

  .about-links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .founder-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(100% 140% at 0 0, rgba(100, 0, 0, 0.18), transparent 60%),
      var(--c-bg-raised);
  }

  .founder-card__identity {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 15rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
    background: #060906;
  }

  .founder-card__identity::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 35% 0 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(2, 5, 3, 0.92));
  }

  .founder-card__identity img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 21rem;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    filter: saturate(0.76) contrast(1.06);
  }

  .founder-card__identity-label {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    inset: auto 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  .founder-card__identity-label .t-mono {
    color: var(--c-faint);
  }

  .founder-card__rule {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--c-garnet-bright);
  }

  .founder-card__role {
    color: var(--c-garnet-text);
  }

  .founder-card__name {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }

  .founder-card__bio {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .founder-card {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 4fr) minmax(0, 8fr);
      align-items: stretch;
    }
  }
</style>
